flowchart TD
    JS[Job Source<br/>LinkedIn / Indeed / Careers / ATS / Newsletter]
    ST[Source Type<br/>What it is]
    CC[Collection Capability<br/>How it can be monitored]
    ORG[Organization<br/>Employer / school / company]
    JL[Job Listing<br/>One published occurrence]
    J[Canonical Job]
    APP[Application]
    AM[Acquisition Method<br/>Crawler / Universal Search / Browser / Email / Manual]
    CF[Crawler Configuration]
    RUN[Crawl Run]
    FOUND[Found via]
    APPLIED[Applied via]
    UNK[Protected Unclassified Source]

    JS --> ST
    JS --> CC
    JS <-->|many-to-many| ORG
    JS --> JL
    ORG --> J
    JL --> J
    AM --> JL
    J --> APP
    JS --> FOUND --> APP
    JS --> APPLIED --> APP
    JS --> CF --> RUN --> JL
    UNK --> JL

    US[Universal Search] -->|Acquisition Method| AM
    BC[Browser Companion] -->|Acquisition Method| AM
    EM[Email] -->|Acquisition Method| AM
    MAN[Manual] -->|Acquisition Method| AM
